  "description": "LINQ query builder and object mapping extensions for CloudflareD1.NET. Provides IQueryable<T> with deferred execution, Distinct() for removing duplicates, Contains()/IN clause for collection filtering, Join operations (INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN), Having clause for filtered aggregations, GroupBy with aggregations (Count, Sum, Average, Min, Max), type-safe query construction with expression trees, Select() projection with computed properties, entity mapping, and fluent API for building SQL queries using lambda expressions.",
