  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0: Advanced Query Features - Added Distinct() method to remove duplicate rows from results (SELECT DISTINCT). Contains()/IN clause support now documented and tested for collection filtering. 11 new unit tests + 6 integration tests. v1.6.0: Join Operations with INNER/LEFT JOIN. v1.5.1: Having() clause for filtered aggregations. 164 total tests passing. Full backward compatibility.",
